cpuPercent.description:
Aggregate CPU% across all cores (0..=100*N_cores in sysinfo's units;
the collector normalises to a 0..=100 single-core scale before
emitting).

mode.description:
The mode to apply, as octal (e.g. `0777`, `775`). REQUIRED when `apply`;
there is no inferred default — the caller confirms an explicit mode chosen
from the detected candidates.

serviceUser.description:
Service user name. When set, also runs the service-user bootstrap
(`useradd`, group membership, linger, optional SSH key). Linux-only;
no-op on macOS.
